\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Paid social requires different placements and formats. Use vertical clips for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts; square or vertical formats for feed placements; and wider scenes where the campaign calls for it. PixVerse supports multiple creative directions, while final platform setup should follow each ad network&rsquo;s current specifications.</span></p><h3 class=\"c3\" id=\"h.z58pbjxxlets\"><span class=\"c4\">Review, Export, and Iterate</span></h3><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Review the generated video for brand safety, claims, product accuracy, and platform compliance. Then use the best-performing direction to generate more variants. PixVerse speeds up production, but human review remains essential for responsible advertising.</span></p><h2 class=\"c5\" id=\"h.3iwd94z87v\"><span class=\"c11\">AI Video Ad Generator Use Cases</span></h2><h3 class=\"c3\" id=\"h.cl68478rv24o\"><span class=\"c4\">Ecommerce Product Ads</span></h3><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Turn product photos into polished motion assets. PixVerse can help showcase texture, use case, lifestyle context, packaging, and product benefits in a more dynamic format than a static image.</span></p><h3 class=\"c3\" id=\"h.d0pga6saayr1\"><span class=\"c4\">DTC Creative Testing</span></h3><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">DTC brands often need fresh ad concepts every week. PixVerse helps create product reveals, benefit-led scenes, UGC-inspired clips, and seasonal campaign assets without starting from a blank editing timeline.</span></p><h3 class=\"c3\" id=\"h.gi1m4pewe42y\"><span class=\"c4\">Agency and Media Buyer Workflows</span></h3><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Agencies can use PixVerse to generate more options for clients, speed up ideation, and create visual examples before committing to larger shoots. Media buyers can test more hooks and angles, then scale the concepts that show promise.</span></p><h3 class=\"c3\" id=\"h.wkqyacnc9sh9\"><span class=\"c4\">App, SaaS, and Digital Product Ads</span></h3><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Software teams can generate visual explainers, app demo concepts, feature stories, and launch assets. PixVerse can support creative directions that feel more cinematic than a simple screen recording.</span></p><h3 class=\"c3\" id=\"h.eb67w3d6a88o\"><span class=\"c4\">Real Estate, Education, and Local Services</span></h3><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Video ads are not only for ecommerce. Real estate agents, schools, restaurants, gyms, and service businesses can use PixVerse to create quick promotional videos, event announcements, and localized campaign assets.</span></p><h2 class=\"c5\" id=\"h.u6zcwrvbzvv\"><span class=\"c11\">Team Plan and Production Control</span></h2><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">Performance teams often struggle with scattered assets, unused credits, and inconsistent handoffs. PixVerse Team Plan concepts are designed for small studios, agencies, and teams that need shared production control. A shared credit pool can reduce waste, role permissions can protect workflows, and asset synchronization can help editors or media buyers reuse the best materials.</span></p><p class=\"c13 c9\"><span class=\"c1\"></span></p><p class=\"c6\"><span class=\"c1\">This matters because ad production is rarely one person making one video. It is a loop between strategist, designer, media buyer, client, editor, and analyst. PixVerse helps compress the creative production part of that loop while leaving strategic review in human hands.</span></p><h2 class=\"c5\" id=\"h.tqclcrsru4v\"><span class=\"c11\">API and Advanced Video Advertising Workflows</span></h2><p class=\"c6\"><span>Some teams need more than a manual app workflow. PixVerse offers </span><span class=\"c10\"><a class=\"c8\" href=\"https://pixverse.ai/en/api-solutions\">API solutions</a></span><span>, </span><span class=\"c10\"><a class=\"c8\" href=\"https://docs.platform.pixverse.ai/\">developer documentation</a></spa